<!-- =============================================================================
     tests/sample_data/silver_falls/breakdown.mms
     Sample Movie Magic Scheduling export — Silver Falls (large ensemble drama).
     20 scenes; 14 cast; 8 locations; all NIGHT shoot; single jurisdiction.
     Tests: large DOOD grid (14 rows × however many shoot days), call-sheet
     density (7-person ensemble in scene 20), long scenes (5.5-6 page),
     8-location stripboard, all-NIGHT scheduling.
     ============================================================================= -->
